<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Gillette buys Czech blade and razor business.</title>
<headline>Gillette buys Czech blade and razor business.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S.-based Gillette Co on Wednesday said that it had bought the blade and razor business of the Czech-based, Astra a.s..</p>
<p>In a statement issued by Gillette's Prague representation, Gillette said Astra, based in Jevicko, is the market leader in blades and razor units in the Czech Republic and Slovakia. The transaction price was not disclosed.</p>
</text>
